Maria Padilha live desktop

The graphical session starts automatically as the unprivileged maria user.
Log out to return to the greetd/tuigreet login screen. Run sudo for installer
or recovery commands. The live ISO is ephemeral: changes are lost on reboot.

For filesystem or bootloader repair, reboot and choose "Maria Padilha Rescue"
in the boot menu. Before a desktop update, save an explicit rollback point:

  sudo maria-padilha-rollback save

Package: maria-padilha
